@startuml

hide footbox

title US007 - To register a new country in the system

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

'Human Interactions between Administrator and System
Administrator -> System : **1** I want to register a new country in the system!
System --> Administrator : **2** What is the name of the country you wish to register?
Administrator -> System : **3** The country name is <countryName>!
System --> Administrator : **4** <countryName> registered successfully!
@enduml